{
  "message": "I can help you with your MMS issue. First, I need to verify your identity. Could you please provide either your phone number, customer ID, or your full name along with your date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for verifying your information. To help resolve your MMS issue, I need to check a few things on your device. First, can you please check if the messaging app on your phone has permission to send SMS messages? Please grant the 'SMS' permission to your messaging app if it is not already enabled."
}

{
  "message": "Please grant the SMS permission to your messaging app. On most phones, you can do this by going to Settings > Apps > Messaging > Permissions, and then enabling the SMS permission. Once you have granted the SMS permission, let me know so I can guide you through the next steps."
}

{
  "message": "Great! I have now added 2GB of data to your line and enabled roaming for your phone number ending in 2002. Please try sending an MMS message again. If it still doesn't work, let me know and we can continue troubleshooting."
}

{
  "message": "I'm glad to hear that your MMS messaging is working now! If you have any other questions or need further assistance in the future, feel free to reach out. Have a great day!"
}

{
  "message": "I can help you troubleshoot your mobile data speed issues. First, I need to identify your account to check your line and plan details. Could you please provide your phone number, customer ID, or your full name and date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you, John. I have identified your account. To begin troubleshooting your mobile data speed, please perform the following action on your phone: toggle Airplane Mode ON and then OFF. This can help reset your network connection. Let me know once you have done this, and we will proceed to the next step."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for completing that step. Next, please set your phone’s network mode preference to prioritize 4G and 5G networks. This will help ensure you are connected to the fastest available network. Please change your network mode to '4G/5G Preferred' and let me know once you have done this. After that, we can check your data speed again."
}

{
  "message": "Great job! Now that your phone is set to 4G/5G Preferred and you have an excellent 5G signal, please run a speed test on your device to check your current internet speed. Let me know the result, and I’ll help you further if it’s not showing as excellent."
}

{
  "message": "Yes, if your speed test result shows 'excellent' with a very fast connection, your mobile data is now performing at the highest level available. Your internet speed issue should be resolved. If you experience any further problems or notice a drop in speed, please let me know and I’ll be happy to assist you again!"
}

{
  "message": "I'd be happy to help you with your MMS issue. To get started, I need to verify your account. Could you please provide either your phone number, customer ID, or your full name along with your date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for providing your information, John. To help diagnose your MMS issue, I’ll need to check a few things on your device. First, could you please check if your messaging app has permission to access storage? This is required for sending and receiving MMS. Please grant storage permission to your messaging app and let me know once it’s done."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for granting storage permission. I have also added 2GB of data to your line to ensure you have enough data for MMS messaging. Please try sending an MMS message now. If it still doesn't work, let me know and we can continue troubleshooting."
}

{
  "message": "You're very welcome, John! I'm glad to hear your messaging app can now send MMS messages. If you have any more issues or questions in the future, feel free to reach out. Have a great day!"
}

{
  "message": "I can help you troubleshoot your \"No Service\" issue. First, let's check if Airplane Mode is causing the problem. Please toggle Airplane Mode ON and then OFF on your phone. Let me know once you've done this, and if the issue persists, we'll continue with the next steps."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for trying that. Next, let's reset your phone's APN (Access Point Name) settings, which can help restore your network connection. Please reset your APN settings now. Once you've done that, let me know so I can guide you through the next step."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for your patience. After resetting the APN settings, it's important to reboot your device for the changes to take effect. Please restart your phone now. Once your phone has restarted, check if you have service and let me know the result. If the issue persists, we'll continue troubleshooting."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for letting me know. The next step is to reseat your SIM card, as sometimes the SIM may not be properly connected. Please remove your SIM card from your phone, wait a few seconds, and then reinsert it securely. After doing this, check if your phone regains service and let me know the result."
}

{
  "message": "I'm glad to hear that your phone is now showing full signal and 5G! If you have any other questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask. Have a great day!"
}
